icle was mainly an attack on the current team.","I thought stating a preference meant the opposing reasons were included only for show."]},"advanced-native-1789-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The piece pushes a particular agenda by arguing for trying the new activity, so I would label it as an opinion rather than a neutral report. Let us keep the objections and open questions visible so readers can judge the case.","The article may push a particular agenda, but I do not want its selection to suggest that everyone already agrees. Could we state my aim clearly and include the strongest concern we have not yet answered?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
