('advanced-native-1800', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1800-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["暫停平常要求，仍有回工作安排。"],"options":["小住仍逐場照開平常會議，沒有任何暫停。","只有去很遠地方才可能符合表達，近處不算。","暫停平常要求，仍有回工作安排。","兩人周一也繼續休息，尚未安排何時回工作。"]},"advanced-native-1800-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The aim was a quieter interval before returning to work.","We planned to pause the normal demands rather than fill the stay with the same routine.","We wanted some distance from the working week, with a clear return time.","We wanted to get away from it all by leaving the usual meetings and messages for a short time."],"options":["The aim was a quieter interval before returning to work.","We planned to pause the normal demands rather than fill the stay with the same routine.","We wanted some distance from the working week, with a clear return time.","We wanted to get away from it all by leaving the usual meetings and messages for a short time."]},"advanced-native-1800-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The distance alone does not show that he managed to get away from it all if the usual demands continue unchanged."],"options":["He has put the usual meetings aside and is spending the days without work messages.","The distance alone does not show that he managed to get away from it all if the usual demands continue unchanged.","He is doing only a brief handover before setting the normal schedule aside for the rest of the stay."]},"advanced-native-1800-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["離開後日常責任已永久不再存在。"],"options":["離開後日常責任已永久不再存在。","有時近處的短暫休息也可符合，需看情境。","暫時離開平常壓力或責任。"]},"advanced-native-1800-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["To get away from it all here, the usual demands need some pause; distance by itself does not provide that."],"options":["If only one afternoon were free of work, I would think it too short to count as getting away.","To get away from it all here, the usual demands need some pause; distance by itself does not provide that.","A distant destination would make the days feel separate from work, even if I kept the normal meetings."]},"advanced-native-1800-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I would like one day to get away from it all, with a book and a quiet walk rather than another packed timetable. Could we leave some time for our own plans and meet again for dinner?","I know you enjoy busy days, but I hoped to get away from it all for part of the break. Perhaps we could each choose the afternoon we want and share the evening, instead of making every activity the same for both of us."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1801', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1801-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["兩人有一段較從容談話時間，仍有六點離開的安排。"],"options":["姊姊獨自離開後，說話者才有時間開始談話。","兩人有一段較從容談話時間，仍有六點離開的安排。","兩人因不知車站出發時間而無法決定何時離開。","兩人每說幾句便看時間，怕錯過下午另一活動。"]},"advanced-native-1801-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We wanted to talk without constantly watching the clock before leaving at six.","My sister and I wanted enough room to finish the conversation.","Another activity in the middle would have made us keep checking how long we had.","We wanted a relaxed interval together, while keeping the station departure in mind."],"options":["We wanted to talk without constantly watching the clock before leaving at six.","My sister and I wanted enough room to finish the conversation.","Another activity in the middle would have made us keep checking how long we had.","We wanted a relaxed interval together, while keeping the station departure in mind."]},"advanced-native-1801-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She read without constantly watching the clock, even though she knew when the library would close."],"options":["She read without constantly watching the clock, even though she knew when the library would close.","She kept checking the remaining time between chapters because closing time was approaching.","She only began reading after she had forgotten when the library closed."]},"advanced-native-1801-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["當事人之後沒有任何需按時履行的安排。"],"options":["當事人這段活動中不用反覆留意剩餘時間。","當事人之後沒有任何需按時履行的安排。","仍可知道何時離開，也能較從容完成當下活動。"]},"advanced-native-1801-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I hoped we could talk without constantly watching the clock; could we leave those visits for another day?"],"options":["We can decide how long to talk only after we have arrived at the station.","I hoped we could talk without constantly watching the clock; could we leave those visits for another day?","Let us keep both visits and shorten the conversation whenever the next activity is due."]},"advanced-native-1801-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Could we choose one topic so she can tell the story without constantly watching the clock? Let us agree a break time with her instead of moving to a new question every ten minutes.","I would like her to speak without constantly watching the clock, with room to finish one memory. We could set a longer session and ask when she would like a break."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1802', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1802-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["兩人回到不同城市後，仍以推薦書及通話維持友誼。"],"options":["兩人回到不同城市後，仍以推薦書及通話維持友誼。","兩人為維持友誼而把旅程延長一個月，尚未回家。","兩人只在旅行中談過書，回家後已沒有聯絡。","兩人每月一起再旅行，沒有在不同城市通話。"]},"advanced-native-1802-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Our monthly calls gave the connection a place in our ordinary routines.","It outlasted the trip itself, with book recommendations and regular calls after we returned.","We stayed in touch even after going back to different cities.","The conversation did not end when the journey did."],"options":["Our monthly calls gave the connection a place in our ordinary routines.","It outlasted the trip itself, with book recommendations and regular calls after we returned.","We stayed in touch even after going back to different cities.","The conversation did not end when the journey did."]},"advanced-native-1802-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The photograph shows some contact after the return, but not that the friendship will outlast the trip itself for years."],"options":["The photograph shows some contact after the return, but not that the friendship will outlast the trip itself for years.","Sending the photograph confirms that regular contact will continue for years.","The photograph was sent during the trip rather than after the student returned."]},"advanced-native-1802-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["友誼之後必定永遠不變。"],"options":["可用旅後聯絡或共同活動說明延續。","友誼在旅行結束後仍在。","友誼之後必定永遠不變。"]},"advanced-native-1802-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Their friendship outlasted the trip itself; the monthly calls show that living apart did not end the contact."],"options":["I would judge whether the friendship continued only by how close their homes are.","Their friendship outlasted the trip itself; the monthly calls show that living apart did not end the contact.","We should describe them as still travelling together because they have kept the friendship."]},"advanced-native-1802-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Did anything you discovered outlast the trip itself? Bring one example of a book you kept reading, a habit you continued or a connection you chose to maintain.","At our meeting, we would like to hear what outlasted the trip itself in your everyday life. You could share a new way of noticing your neighbourhood, without needing a story about a lasting friendship."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1803', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1803-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["旅行已結束，兩人仍記起那次幫忙。"],"options":["兩人回家一月仍未整理行李，只在找失去的物品。","陌生人每月都再帶他們去同一街道。","兩人已不記得旅途中誰曾幫忙。","旅行已結束，兩人仍記起那次幫忙。"]},"advanced-native-1803-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["One unexpected act of kindness has become part of our conversations at home.","The journey is over, though that encounter is still easy to bring to mind.","The bags are put away, but the memories stay with us, especially the help we received in finding that street.","We still talk about the person who helped us find the old address."],"options":["One unexpected act of kindness has become part of our conversations at home.","The journey is over, though that encounter is still easy to bring to mind.","The bags are put away, but the memories stay with us, especially the help we received in finding that street.","We still talk about the person who helped us find the old address."]},"advanced-native-1803-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The line “The bags are put away, but the memories stay with us” can describe the remembered singing without claiming every name is clear."],"options":["Remembering the feeling confirms that the student can identify everyone in the photograph.","She could repeat the song’s words, although she has forgotten the names of the singers.","The line “The bags are put away, but the memories stay with us” can describe the remembered singing without claiming every name is clear."]},"advanced-native-1803-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["回憶仍在，就證明每項細節都準確。"],"options":["回憶仍在，就證明每項細節都準確。","仍可指出記得甚麼，以及哪些地方需問別人。","旅行已完，某段經驗仍被想起。"]},"advanced-native-1803-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The bags are put away, but the memories stay with us; I mean that the encounter still matters, not that we have left the cases open."],"options":["The bags are put away, but the memories stay with us; I mean that the encounter still matters, not that we have left the cases open.","I took remembering the encounter to mean we were still occupied with unpacking the cases.","I took the line to mean we were planning to repeat the trip, rather than remembering one encounter."]},"advanced-native-1803-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The bags are put away, but the memories stay with us. Setting out the breakfast cups still reminds me of the mornings at your table, and I am grateful for that welcome.","The bags are put away, but the memories stay with us. Thank you for the mornings of shared breakfast and talk about home; they come back to me whenever I set the table."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1804', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1804-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["作息錯開，兩人主要靠字條交流，未描述爭吵。"],"options":["兩人已搬到不同住處，只在旅途中碰面。","兩人工作時段已變相同，字條只是記採購清單。","作息錯開，兩人主要靠字條交流，未描述爭吵。","兩人每天同時下班，在水壺旁長談。"]},"advanced-native-1804-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I left early and Leah got back after I was usually asleep.","There was little time when we were both at home and awake.","The notes gave us a way to communicate around our separate routines.","We were running on different tracks, with very different working hours."],"options":["I left early and Leah got back after I was usually asleep.","There was little time when we were both at home and awake.","The notes gave us a way to communicate around our separate routines.","We were running on different tracks, with very different working hours."]},"advanced-native-1804-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Different interests alone do not show they are running on different tracks with no shared time; they have a regular meal and discussion."],"options":["The Tuesday meal is still only a plan that the friends have not yet tried.","Their working hours already coincide; only their leisure interests differ.","Different interests alone do not show they are running on different tracks with no shared time; they have a regular meal and discussion."]},"advanced-native-1804-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["兩人一定互相不關心。"],"options":["兩人一定互相不關心。","仍需具體情境說明在哪方面不同步。","各自生活方向或作息缺少配合或交集。"]},"advanced-native-1804-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We are running on different tracks, and I miss actually talking; could we find one evening for a meal rather than only leave more notes?"],"options":["A larger board should be our next step, without checking whether there is an evening we could share.","Let us keep notes as our main contact and wait until the busy season ends before finding a shared evening.","We are running on different tracks, and I miss actually talking; could we find one evening for a meal rather than only leave more notes?"]},"advanced-native-1804-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Both teams are working hard, but we are running on different tracks with two versions of the topic. Could we compare the film and display together before the joint presentation?","We seem to be running on different tracks rather than falling behind. Let us agree on the shared topic and check where the two pieces need to connect."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1805', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1805-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["周末暫停晚飯查工作訊息的習慣，周一再處理。"],"options":["兩人先結束周末探訪，才開始暫停查工作訊息。","周末暫停晚飯查工作訊息的習慣，周一再處理。","兩人已決定永久離開原有工作，不再收訊息。","探訪期間仍每晚照舊查訊息，只改了吃飯地方。"]},"advanced-native-1805-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We wanted to press pause on that routine of checking work messages over dinner.","We wanted the meal to be time together rather than another inbox session.","The repeated evening message checks were what we hoped to leave until Monday.","We wanted a temporary change in how we spent dinner, not a permanent end to the jobs."],"options":["We wanted to press pause on that routine of checking work messages over dinner.","We wanted the meal to be time together rather than another inbox session.","The repeated evening message checks were what we hoped to leave until Monday.","We wanted a temporary change in how we spent dinner, not a permanent end to the jobs."]},"advanced-native-1805-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["He pressed pause on the routine of daily updates during the break and arranged to resume it afterwards."],"options":["The handover means he has permanently withdrawn from the project.","He continued writing the daily updates throughout the holiday before handing over.","He pressed pause on the routine of daily updates during the break and arranged to resume it afterwards."]},"advanced-native-1805-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["從此永久取消那項活動，不可能恢復。"],"options":["仍需說明原有日常及暫停多久。","暫時中斷前面已說的重複安排。","從此永久取消那項活動，不可能恢復。"]},"advanced-native-1805-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["To press pause on that routine, I meant leaving the message checks until Monday, not moving them to a different dinner time."],"options":["We should choose a different restaurant before discussing whether to check the inbox.","To press pause on that routine, I meant leaving the message checks until Monday, not moving them to a different dinner time.","Let us keep the inbox open and count the later meal as the change we agreed."]},"advanced-native-1805-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Could we press pause on our routine of comparing page totals at the next meeting? I suggest bringing one question each, then deciding together whether the change helps us talk about the reading.","I would like to press pause on that routine of starting with page counts and try a question from each reader instead. We can review it afterwards rather than decide the format for every future meeting now."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1806', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1806-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["暫離後兩人較願重新談共同點，結尾仍未改完。"],"options":["暫離後兩人較願重新談共同點，結尾仍未改完。","分開一天已令草稿結尾完成，兩人只需送印。","兩人回來後仍拒絕談任何共同點，沒有態度改變。","兩人只改了標點，未談過怎重新處理草稿。"]},"advanced-native-1806-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We could begin with what we shared, although the ending was still unfinished.","It felt like a reset button, and we were ready to look for points of agreement.","We came back less fixed on repeating the same argument.","The break gave us a fresh starting point for discussing the draft."],"options":["We could begin with what we shared, although the ending was still unfinished.","It felt like a reset button, and we were ready to look for points of agreement.","We came back less fixed on repeating the same argument.","The break gave us a fresh starting point for discussing the draft."]},"advanced-native-1806-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The break may have been pleasant, but this account does not yet show it acting like a reset button for the discussion."],"options":["A more pleasant mood alone confirms that the discussion now has a fresh approach.","The person has stopped repeating the argument and started comparing the options calmly.","The break may have been pleasant, but this account does not yet show it acting like a reset button for the discussion."]},"advanced-native-1806-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["之前發生的事已被抹去，未完工作也已完成。"],"options":["仍需說實際改變了甚麼及之後做甚麼。","當事人覺得有重新開始或整理思緒的機會。","之前發生的事已被抹去，未完工作也已完成。"]},"advanced-native-1806-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It was a reset button for how we approached the draft, but we still need to rewrite the ending."],"options":["I would reopen the same objections in their original order rather than begin with the points we now share.","It was a reset button for how we approached the draft, but we still need to rewrite the ending.","We can treat the fresh feeling as the last revision and send the draft now."]},"advanced-native-1806-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I want this weekend to be a reset button for my reading habits, starting with a clear corner and one book I actually want to read. I do not need to finish last term’s entire list before opening it.","Making a reading corner feels like pressing reset: I can choose one book and give it a regular place in my week. The older list is still there, but it does not have to be tonight’s task."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1807', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1807-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["海港外觀很美，旅程安排卻有錯失，兩人仍能笑着面對。"],"options":["海港光線不適合拍照，但所有交通安排很順。","兩人按正確時間表搭到末班船，不需要巴士。","因海港好看，兩人沒有察覺末班船已離開。","海港外觀很美，旅程安排卻有錯失，兩人仍能笑着面對。"]},"advanced-native-1807-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We had a beautiful evening view and a rather less organised departure.","It was not a flawless outing, though we could laugh about the mistake.","The harbour was picture-perfect, even though we got the boat time wrong.","It looked wonderful, but the journey home involved an unexpected wait."],"options":["We had a beautiful evening view and a rather less organised departure.","It was not a flawless outing, though we could laugh about the mistake.","The harbour was picture-perfect, even though we got the boat time wrong.","It looked wonderful, but the journey home involved an unexpected wait."]},"advanced-native-1807-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The photograph shows a picture-perfect beach, but visitors should check the current entrance arrangements."],"options":["The picture already includes the entrance works as well as the shoreline, so no separate access note is needed.","The photograph shows a picture-perfect beach, but visitors should check the current entrance arrangements.","The photograph is sufficient evidence that the main entrance is open today."]},"advanced-native-1807-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["在這裏發生的每項活動都已順利安排。"],"options":["場景看起來理想漂亮。","在這裏發生的每項活動都已順利安排。","實際體驗仍需按所發生的事描述。"]},"advanced-native-1807-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The harbour was picture-perfect; that describes the view, not whether we caught the right bus."],"options":["The harbour was picture-perfect; that describes the view, not whether we caught the right bus.","I took picture-perfect to mean that the whole outing, including the journey home, went smoothly.","I would check only whether the evening light will be similar before deciding to repeat that return route."]},"advanced-native-1807-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["My first cup is not picture-perfect, but its uneven handle reminds me how many times I tried again. I would like to share the making as well as the finished photograph.","This is not a picture-perfect cup; I kept changing the handle as I learned. The photograph can show where I have started, without pretending I have finished learning."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1809', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1809-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者欣賞風景，但之後更常談一段人與人的交流。"],"options":["說話者回來後只談景色，沒有再提職員。","說話者欣賞風景，但之後更常談一段人與人的交流。","說話者只見過明信片，沒有到湖邊。","渡輪職員只提供拍照位置，兩人沒談其他事情。"]},"advanced-native-1809-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The postcard view was beautiful, but the conversation at the ferry office stayed with me most.","I keep returning to what the woman told us during that long conversation.","The scenery mattered, though the human encounter became the part I spoke about later.","I remember the exchange at the office more vividly than the photograph I took."],"options":["The postcard view was beautiful, but the conversation at the ferry office stayed with me most.","I keep returning to what the woman told us during that long conversation.","The scenery mattered, though the human encounter became the part I spoke about later.","I remember the exchange at the office more vividly than the photograph I took."]},"advanced-native-1809-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Choosing the postcard view for this scenic photograph does not itself deny that other experiences matter."],"options":["The scenic brief also requires an account of the residents’ daily routines.","The photograph establishes that residents value the scenery more than their relationships.","Choosing the postcard view for this scenic photograph does not itself deny that other experiences matter."]},"advanced-native-1809-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["這幅景色必定偽造，沒有真實地方。"],"options":["某景色被比作漂亮的明信片畫面。","這幅景色必定偽造，沒有真實地方。","可再問當事人還重視哪些經歷。"]},"advanced-native-1809-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The postcard view shows one part of the visit; I would also like to include what our conversation helped us notice."],"options":["The postcard view shows one part of the visit; I would also like to include what our conversation helped us notice.","I would leave the conversation out of this article and use the available space for more viewpoints around the lake.","I understood the photograph as the main reason the visit mattered, rather than what we learned in the conversation."]},"advanced-native-1809-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The postcard view of the hills is still recognisable, but the new ferry terminal changes the foreground. These pictures show two views of the shore, not a full account of how residents’ lives have changed.","We can still find the postcard view in today’s photograph, alongside a terminal that was absent ten years ago. The comparison makes the changed foreground visible without deciding what that change means for everyone who lives here."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1810', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1810-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["作者加入一位乘客的生活與連繫經驗，也保留海岸。"],"options":["作者決定把這一位乘客的安排說成所有乘客的作息。","作者加入一位乘客的生活與連繫經驗，也保留海岸。","作者用海岸照片推測乘客每周探誰，沒有詢問。","乘客被問的只是海岸拍攝光線，沒有日常經驗。"]},"advanced-native-1810-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We wanted the human view of the crossing, including how it helped her keep a family connection.","Her routine showed what the service meant in one person’s life.","We wanted a lived experience alongside the coastline description.","The visits connected the journey with a relationship, not just a route on the water."],"options":["We wanted the human view of the crossing, including how it helped her keep a family connection.","Her routine showed what the service meant in one person’s life.","We wanted a lived experience alongside the coastline description.","The visits connected the journey with a relationship, not just a route on the water."]},"advanced-native-1810-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Both accounts contribute to the human view, showing different ways the service affects family contact."],"options":["Both passengers are primarily asking for a later final sailing.","Both accounts contribute to the human view, showing different ways the service affects family contact.","Only the positive account belongs in the human view; the difficulty with evening visits is merely a timetable detail."]},"advanced-native-1810-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["把一位受訪者的經驗當所有人的共同看法。"],"options":["留意人的生活與連繫。","把一位受訪者的經驗當所有人的共同看法。","可與景色或路線描述並列，交代誰的經驗。"]},"advanced-native-1810-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The human view here is her experience; we can name it clearly and ask others before broadening the claim."],"options":["I thought the human view required a dramatic personal story, rather than ordinary weekly visits.","The human view here is her experience; we can name it clearly and ask others before broadening the claim.","The same service means the same family purpose, so no more questions are needed."]},"advanced-native-1810-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Help us bring the human view into our school feature by choosing one place and telling us about an encounter there. Different feelings are welcome; your account does not have to praise the building.","For the human view of the new school, we would like your memory of sharing a particular space with someone. Please tell us whose experience it is rather than write on behalf of the whole year."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1811', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1811-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["一起煮飯後兩人恢復關心彼近日生活，家務安排仍待談。"],"options":["家務輪值已全部議定，所以兩人不用再談。","兩人只有分配食材，沒有恢復彼此交流。","一起煮飯後兩人恢復關心彼近日生活，家務安排仍待談。","兩人回到以前住處，卻仍沒互問近況。"]},"advanced-native-1811-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We started taking an interest in what the other person had been doing.","The shared task made room for a conversation we had been missing.","We felt connected again, even though the rota still needed discussion.","It helped bring us back to one another after a month of hardly talking."],"options":["We started taking an interest in what the other person had been doing.","The shared task made room for a conversation we had been missing.","We felt connected again, even though the rota still needed discussion.","It helped bring us back to one another after a month of hardly talking."]},"advanced-native-1811-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The calls have brought them back to one another emotionally, although they still live in different cities."],"options":["Regular calls are a future proposal; the siblings have not yet begun that pattern of contact.","The calls have brought them back to one another emotionally, although they still live in different cities.","The calls still contain only occasional holiday greetings, rather than discussion of their ordinary weeks."]},"advanced-native-1811-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["人們之間每個未解問題都已處理完。"],"options":["原有距離之後，人們重新感到連繫。","人們之間每個未解問題都已處理完。","仍可有不同住處或需要另談的安排。"]},"advanced-native-1811-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Cooking helped bring us back to one another; I would like to keep that connection while finding a fair way to share the chores."],"options":["Let us keep the old rota without asking whether the hours still fit us.","We should discuss only the list of chores and stop asking about each other’s days.","Cooking helped bring us back to one another; I would like to keep that connection while finding a fair way to share the chores."]},"advanced-native-1811-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The reunion helped bring us back to one another, and I would like to give that contact a little space beyond one evening. Would anyone enjoy an optional monthly update, with no pressure to reply each time?","Hearing your news brought us back to one another after so long apart. Perhaps we could share one recent event each month, while leaving everyone free to read quietly or join in when they wish."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1813', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1813-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者因當下聽到歌的興趣，臨時改了自己下午計劃。"],"options":["說話者因當下聽到歌的興趣，臨時改了自己下午計劃。","廣場被確認關閉，所以說話者按事先備案改路。","旅伴不同意廣場行程，兩人商量後另選活動。","說話者早已預訂下午聽歌，原沒有廣場計劃。"]},"advanced-native-1813-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I was on my own and chose to follow a passing interest that afternoon.","I could change course on a whim, and the music caught my interest.","I suddenly wanted to stay and listen to the song.","The idea came from hearing the music, not from a problem with the square."],"options":["I was on my own and chose to follow a passing interest that afternoon.","I could change course on a whim, and the music caught my interest.","I suddenly wanted to stay and listen to the song.","The idea came from hearing the music, not from a problem with the square."]},"advanced-native-1813-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The team changed course on a whim, without a reason to reconsider the outdoor plan."],"options":["The change responded to an expected constraint rather than a passing wish.","The team changed course on a whim, without a reason to reconsider the outdoor plan.","The team revised its plan after new information and discussion."]},"advanced-native-1813-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["每次有新證據而調整計劃都屬這種情況。"],"options":["每次有新證據而調整計劃都屬這種情況。","要看改動原因，才能分一時興起與經考慮調整。","一個短暫念頭促成改變計劃。"]},"advanced-native-1813-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["You can change course on a whim when your own plans are at stake, but we need to check the shared arrangements before changing this group’s route."],"options":["I would check whether I can manage the new route, rather than whether it fits the group’s arrangements and the other leader’s responsibilities.","You can change course on a whim when your own plans are at stake, but we need to check the shared arrangements before changing this group’s route.","Let us announce the new destination first and ask the other leader after the group arrives."]},"advanced-native-1813-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Before we change course on a whim, could you explain what the new image would add to the cover? I am open to it, but we should weigh that benefit against getting permission again and delaying the printing.","I do not want us to change course on a whim just because another picture feels new tonight. Let us compare its purpose with the current cover before deciding whether the extra work is worthwhile."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1814', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1814-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者因可自己選擇及停留，感到較自由。"],"options":["全組已決定一起進畫廊，所以說話者照跟原時間表。","說話者因可自己選擇及停留，感到較自由。","說話者量度了呼吸，證實肺部有某種改變。","說話者仍需每次停留都等全組同意，沒有選擇改變。"]},"advanced-native-1814-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It felt like breathing with my full lungs because I could choose where to stop.","I did not have to fit each small decision into the group’s timetable.","For a while I could follow my own interest without rearranging everyone else’s day.","The gallery could be my choice for the afternoon rather than a proposal I needed others to accept."],"options":["It felt like breathing with my full lungs because I could choose where to stop.","I did not have to fit each small decision into the group’s timetable.","For a while I could follow my own interest without rearranging everyone else’s day.","The gallery could be my choice for the afternoon rather than a proposal I needed others to accept."]},"advanced-native-1814-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Her account does not describe the trip as breathing with her full lungs; she says the decisions felt more constraining on her own."],"options":["Being alone is enough to establish that she felt freer at each decision.","She has reported enjoying the freedom of choosing without discussion.","Her account does not describe the trip as breathing with her full lungs; she says the decisions felt more constraining on her own."]},"advanced-native-1814-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["它已證明某種旅行改善了肺部機能。"],"options":["當事人在這個情境感到較少束縛。","它已證明某種旅行改善了肺部機能。","需看實際少了哪種限制，不能由形式替他人定感受。"]},"advanced-native-1814-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It felt like breathing with my full lungs for me that afternoon; I would still want to ask what kind of trip suits you."],"options":["I understood the feeling as evidence that the gallery itself is less crowded than the other places.","It felt like breathing with my full lungs for me that afternoon; I would still want to ask what kind of trip suits you.","I would take my reaction as a reason for you to choose the same arrangement before we discuss your preferences."]},"advanced-native-1814-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Writing the village story in my own voice felt like breathing with my full lungs. I could finally choose the words I knew, though I still want readers to tell me where the story needs a clearer explanation.","It was like breathing with my full lungs to stop reshaping every line into someone else’s tone. I would like to keep that freedom while listening to questions that could help me revise the story."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1815', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1815-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Nora 提出願接受的參與條件，安排仍待主辦者確認。"],"options":["主辦者已確認每位參展者都毋須演講。","Nora 決定不給畫，也不再參與展覽。","Nora 提出願接受的參與條件，安排仍待主辦者確認。","Nora 已答應演講，只想讓主辦者替她選內容。"]},"advanced-native-1815-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["She hoped her work could be included without a speaking role she did not want.","Showing two drawings was acceptable to her, while a public speech was not.","She wanted the organisers to consider a particular boundary before confirming her place.","She wanted to participate on her own terms, with drawings but no public speech if the organisers agreed."],"options":["She hoped her work could be included without a speaking role she did not want.","Showing two drawings was acceptable to her, while a public speech was not.","She wanted the organisers to consider a particular boundary before confirming her place.","She wanted to participate on her own terms, with drawings but no public speech if the organisers agreed."]},"advanced-native-1815-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Working on his own terms does not by itself cancel the shared decision process he agreed to."],"options":["Working on his own terms does not by itself cancel the shared decision process he agreed to.","His preference is enough to establish that the group has agreed to the new list.","The earlier agreement concerned only his own items, not a shared selection."]},"advanced-native-1815-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["其他人已必須接受所有條件，毋須商量。"],"options":["涉及共同安排時仍可需雙方確認。","當事人重視自己選擇或接受的條件。","其他人已必須接受所有條件，毋須商量。"]},"advanced-native-1815-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["She wants to join on her own terms, so let us ask whether the drawings can be included without a speech before assuming she must withdraw."],"options":["I would tell her that showing the drawings should come with whatever speaking role the organisers assign.","I would focus on choosing a shorter speech for her before asking whether she wants any speaking part.","She wants to join on her own terms, so let us ask whether the drawings can be included without a speech before assuming she must withdraw."]},"advanced-native-1815-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["My grandfather has shared these memories on his own terms, choosing which stories belong in this album and which remain within the family. This selection reflects those choices, not permission to publish everything he told us.","He wanted to tell the story on his own terms, with some photographs kept for family viewing only. We have followed that boundary in making the album and will ask again before sharing it more widely."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1817', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1817-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["旅途中說話者反思自己的選擇，留下問題，未有定案。"],"options":["旅途中說話者反思自己的選擇，留下問題，未有定案。","另一位乘客替說話者選好了回家後的工作。","說話者一直出聲重述行程，沒有考慮自己的選擇。","兩個問題已在上車前全部解決，火車只用來抄答案。"]},"advanced-native-1817-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I used the quiet time to reflect rather than rush to a decision.","It became a conversation with myself about the work I kept accepting.","I was trying to understand a pattern in my own choices.","I wrote questions about what I enjoyed and what I had simply kept doing."],"options":["I used the quiet time to reflect rather than rush to a decision.","It became a conversation with myself about the work I kept accepting.","I was trying to understand a pattern in my own choices.","I wrote questions about what I enjoyed and what I had simply kept doing."]},"advanced-native-1817-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The silence alone does not establish a conversation with himself about leaving his job."],"options":["The silence alone does not establish a conversation with himself about leaving his job.","His quiet appearance is enough to identify leaving his job as the question he is considering.","His stillness shows that he is reviewing a decision already made rather than considering options."]},"advanced-native-1817-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["一定有人聽見當事人大聲說話。"],"options":["一定有人聽見當事人大聲說話。","可以尚未有答案，先把問題看清。","當事人反思自己的問題或感受。"]},"advanced-native-1817-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It was a conversation with myself, not a final decision; I want to understand the questions before choosing what to do."],"options":["I thought an unresolved conversation with myself was just indecision, so it would be better to put the questions away.","It was a conversation with myself, not a final decision; I want to understand the questions before choosing what to do.","I will take the questions as a decision and start telling people I am leaving."]},"advanced-native-1817-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I want this diary to be a conversation with myself, not another tally of completed tasks. Each week I will choose one small moment and ask why it mattered, leaving room to return to the question later.","A weekly page could become a conversation with myself about the choices hidden inside ordinary days. I can ask how I would respond next time without requiring a finished answer tonight."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1818', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1818-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["暫不回訊息讓說話者較能留意自己想法。"],"options":["一小時內說話者繼續立即回每訊息，未有暫停。","暫不回訊息讓說話者較能留意自己想法。","說話者搬進更大房間，才找到放行李的位置。","說話者已同意每項建議，所以不需考慮自己想法。"]},"advanced-native-1818-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It gave me inner space to work out what I actually wanted.","I could consider the suggestions before responding to them.","There was room to hear my own preferences among the messages.","The pause helped me separate my wishes from the pressure to answer quickly."],"options":["It gave me inner space to work out what I actually wanted.","I could consider the suggestions before responding to them.","There was room to hear my own preferences among the messages.","The pause helped me separate my wishes from the pressure to answer quickly."]},"advanced-native-1818-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She has described finding inner space within a shared room, not acquiring a separate physical room."],"options":["She has described finding inner space within a shared room, not acquiring a separate physical room.","The shared room proves that she could not reflect while writing the notes.","She postponed thinking about the questions until she had found a separate room."]},"advanced-native-1818-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["已經取得一間更大或獨立的房間。"],"options":["有心裏餘地留意自己的想法。","已經取得一間更大或獨立的房間。","需看哪些要求暫放下，以及當事人感受。"]},"advanced-native-1818-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I want some inner space to choose, not an end to seeing people; could we leave an hour unplanned before confirming the visits?"],"options":["I want some inner space to choose, not an end to seeing people; could we leave an hour unplanned before confirming the visits?","I would accept the whole schedule now and decide what I want only after every visit is booked.","I thought wanting time to reflect meant there was no place for shared plans at all."]},"advanced-native-1818-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Could we give ourselves some inner space before combining everyone’s ideas into the farewell speech? Five minutes of private notes, followed by an optional memory to share, might help us hear what each person values.","I would like some inner space to find my own words before we edit the shared speech. Perhaps we could write separately first and each choose one part we are comfortable bringing to the group."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1819', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1819-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["旅行由較固定的一次外出，改成組員可影響日期及活動，仍受預算限制。"],"options":["組員只可回顧過去，尚未有任何新的參與方式。","這描述只報告今年巴士換了外觀，沒有安排方式轉變。","旅行由較固定的一次外出，改成組員可影響日期及活動，仍受預算限制。","旅行仍完全按舊巴士行程，組員不能提任何部分。"]},"advanced-native-1819-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Members now have a say in dates and a shared activity.","The old set outing has become a more participatory arrangement.","We can influence parts of the plan while still working within a budget.","It has gone from being a yearly coach outing to something people can shape through their suggestions."],"options":["Members now have a say in dates and a shared activity.","The old set outing has become a more participatory arrangement.","We can influence parts of the plan while still working within a budget.","It has gone from being a yearly coach outing to something people can shape through their suggestions."]},"advanced-native-1819-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The exhibition has gone from being a teacher-set task to something people can shape, within the agreed venue and deadline."],"options":["The exhibition has gone from being a teacher-set task to something people can shape, within the agreed venue and deadline.","The new choice of topic means the venue and deadline are now each student’s decision too.","The change only concerns when the same teacher-selected display is put up."]},"advanced-native-1819-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["其中一項選擇增加，就表示全部條件已可任意決定。"],"options":["應比較先前狀態與現在可塑造的部分。","其中一項選擇增加，就表示全部條件已可任意決定。","仍可同時存在預算、期限或共同約定。"]},"advanced-native-1819-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It has gone from being a set outing to something people can shape, but the suggestions still need to fit our budget."],"options":["It has gone from being a set outing to something people can shape, but the suggestions still need to fit our budget.","I thought having a choice of activity meant the costs would be covered regardless of which one we chose.","I thought members could only comment on an already fixed date, not suggest activities as well."]},"advanced-native-1819-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The programme has gone from being an occasional staff-led talk to something people can shape through questions and small-group proposals. Bring an idea to the desk, and we will discuss how it might fit the available places and opening hours.","Our reading programme has gone from being a single set event to something people can shape, including by offering to lead a small group. Ask at the desk about submitting a proposal; the spaces and hours still need to be agreed."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1820', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1820-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["小組逐步存款已有房租所需金額，錄音師供應仍待問。"],"options":["小組逐步存款已有房租所需金額，錄音師供應仍待問。","小組已付清錄音並錄完，現在只等賣成品。","小組每次把全部義賣收入花掉，未曾留錢。","六月收到的是錄音師確認，不是累積金額達房租。"]},"advanced-native-1820-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Keeping some income back gave the club a way to prepare for that later cost.","We were saving up for a recording session rather than spending the whole amount after each sale.","We wanted the small amounts to build towards the room cost.","The session was a planned expense we wanted the club to prepare for."],"options":["Keeping some income back gave the club a way to prepare for that later cost.","We were saving up for a recording session rather than spending the whole amount after each sale.","We wanted the small amounts to build towards the room cost.","The session was a planned expense we wanted the club to prepare for."]},"advanced-native-1820-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She is saving up for a sketchbook, not reporting that she has already bought it."],"options":["Choosing a model confirms that she has completed the purchase.","The weekly money is a refund from a sketchbook she no longer owns.","She is saving up for a sketchbook, not reporting that she has already bought it."]},"advanced-native-1820-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["相關物品或服務已買妥。"],"options":["正逐步積錢供某項用途。","相關物品或服務已買妥。","仍可需問目前存多少，以及供應或價格情況。"]},"advanced-native-1820-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We saved up for the room, but the engineer’s availability is a separate question; let us ask before confirming a date."],"options":["I assumed having the room money meant the engineer’s time was included in our arrangement.","I would set the date now and find out about the engineer only when we arrive.","We saved up for the room, but the engineer’s availability is a separate question; let us ask before confirming a date."]},"advanced-native-1820-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["We were saving