('advanced-native-1821', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1821-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["旅程周四才為即將到的周末安排，仍有核交通。"],"options":["旅程幾月前已定，周四只是回覆一直未讀的介紹。","兩人未看交通便已到表姊家，沒有行前核對。","表姊拒絕那周末接待，所以兩人定下年再去。","旅程周四才為即將到的周末安排，仍有核交通。"]},"advanced-native-1821-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We had not been planning that visit for months beforehand.","The opportunity came up shortly before the dates we could use.","It was a last-minute trip because we only received the invitation on Thursday for that weekend.","There were only a couple of days between the invitation and leaving."],"options":["We had not been planning that visit for months beforehand.","The opportunity came up shortly before the dates we could use.","It was a last-minute trip because we only received the invitation on Thursday for that weekend.","There were only a couple of days between the invitation and leaving."]},"advanced-native-1821-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The ticket purchase was late, but this account does not describe arranging a last-minute trip."],"options":["The family received the first invitation only after buying the tickets in July.","The ticket purchase was late, but this account does not describe arranging a last-minute trip.","The visit should be described as a last-minute trip because the tickets were bought in July."]},"advanced-native-1821-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["旅費必定比提早安排更便宜。"],"options":["旅費必定比提早安排更便宜。","仍可在有限時間內核交通及住宿。","旅程在出發前不久才安排。"]},"advanced-native-1821-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I am interested in a last-minute trip, but let us check the Sunday return before accepting the invitation."],"options":["I am interested in a last-minute trip, but let us check the Sunday return before accepting the invitation.","I would confirm first and assume there will be a train at the time we need.","I thought a spontaneous invitation meant we should avoid agreeing on a return time."]},"advanced-native-1821-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["It was a last-minute trip after my family offered a chance to visit, not a plan to avoid our gathering. I checked with you about moving it first, and I would like to confirm the new date now.","The family invitation led to a last-minute trip, which is why I asked to rearrange our meeting. Thank you for agreeing; could we settle the replacement date rather than leave it uncertain?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1822', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1822-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["換到湖邊後，工作訊息仍佔了原想休息的時間。"],"options":["工作要求只在回家後才出現，小屋沒有任何聯絡。","人物只擔心旅行行李，沒有工作訊息內容。","換到湖邊後，工作訊息仍佔了原想休息的時間。","兩人早已停止接收工作訊息，首小時只談湖景。"]},"advanced-native-1822-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We were still deciding how to respond to the usual work messages.","The location changed, but the morning demands had not been left behind.","The first hour went into deciding which requests needed an answer rather than the quiet time we had hoped for.","Modern life follows us wherever we go, it seemed: the work requests were still coming into the chat."],"options":["We were still deciding how to respond to the usual work messages.","The location changed, but the morning demands had not been left behind.","The first hour went into deciding which requests needed an answer rather than the quiet time we had hoped for.","Modern life follows us wherever we go, it seemed: the work requests were still coming into the chat."]},"advanced-native-1822-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The phone alone does not show that modern life follows us wherever we go in the sense of continuing work demands."],"options":["The phone alone does not show that modern life follows us wherever we go in the sense of continuing work demands.","The family update should be classified as an ordinary work request rather than personal contact.","The traveller has reported spending the exhibition replying to the work chat."]},"advanced-native-1822-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["使用電話的每個人必定無法休息。"],"options":["仍需指出哪些訊息或責任實際持續。","換地點未必已放下原有要求。","使用電話的每個人必定無法休息。"]},"advanced-native-1822-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Modern life follows us wherever we go when the same work channels stay active; could we agree which requests wait until our return?"],"options":["Modern life follows us wherever we go when the same work channels stay active; could we agree which requests wait until our return?","I thought distance would change which messages reached the group, even with the same notification settings.","I would answer every routine request immediately and decide on a boundary only after the stay."]},"advanced-native-1822-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I am sorry I was distracted at dinner; modern life seemed to follow me wherever I went through the club messages I kept answering. Your welcome mattered to me, and I would like to arrange another evening when I can give our conversation my attention.","Modern life follows us wherever we go when we keep the same demands active, and I brought that pattern to your table. Thank you for the meal; could we choose another time together after I have handed over the club replies?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1823', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1823-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["景色改了，原想共處的時間卻仍被相同工作方式佔着。"],"options":["原本安排就是遠程上班，說話者沒期待共處休息。","景色改了，原想共處的時間卻仍被相同工作方式佔着。","兩人關掉工作通話，整天一起在海邊吃飯。","小住只因不能上網而取消，兩人沒有到海邊。"]},"advanced-native-1823-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It became a change of scenery with Wi-Fi instead of the shared break I had wanted.","The work calls and separate laptop meals carried on much as before.","The sea view changed, but how we spent our time together did not.","I had hoped for a different pace rather than the same routine beside another window."],"options":["It became a change of scenery with Wi-Fi instead of the shared break I had wanted.","The work calls and separate laptop meals carried on much as before.","The sea view changed, but how we spent our time together did not.","I had hoped for a different pace rather than the same routine beside another window."]},"advanced-native-1823-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Internet access alone does not make this a change of scenery with Wi-Fi in the critical sense; the account includes a genuine pause from work."],"options":["The friends spent the walks answering the same office calls as before.","Internet access alone does not make this a change of scenery with Wi-Fi in the critical sense; the account includes a genuine pause from work.","The map search establishes that the ordinary work routine continued throughout the holiday."]},"advanced-native-1823-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["只要有無線網絡，任何旅行都不可能有真正休息。"],"options":["環境改變，原本要求或干擾卻仍在。","只要有無線網絡，任何旅行都不可能有真正休息。","可比較原期待與實際時間怎被使用。"]},"advanced-native-1823-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I do not want another change of scenery with Wi-Fi; could we agree on some time without the usual calls before choosing the room?"],"options":["I thought the problem was only the destination, not the work pattern we brought with us.","I do not want another change of scenery with Wi-Fi; could we agree on some time without the usual calls before choosing the room?","I would choose the better window view first and expect it to change how much time the calls take."]},"advanced-native-1823-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I should describe this as a change of scenery with Wi-Fi, since I will be working most weekdays rather than taking a shared holiday. Would a working stay suit you, or should we plan a separate break when I can leave the calls behind?","Before you accept, I should make clear that this would be a change of scenery with Wi-Fi, not a week of free afternoons together. If you want a shared holiday, I would rather choose another time than promise company I cannot give."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1824', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1824-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者已在海港，但心思仍在會議，未留意共處談話。"],"options":["說話者已在海港，但心思仍在會議，未留意共處談話。","兩人因交通延誤，仍未到達海港地址。","說話者專注聽船的事，回家後才想起會議。","弟弟整段談話都在協助計劃周一會議。"]},"advanced-native-1824-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The destination had changed before my attention had caught up with it.","I had travelled far without fully arriving, because I was still mentally occupied by the meeting.","My body was at the harbour, but my attention was on Monday’s work.","I missed much of the conversation because I was rehearsing another task in my head."],"options":["The destination had changed before my attention had caught up with it.","I had travelled far without fully arriving, because I was still mentally occupied by the meeting.","My body was at the harbour, but my attention was on Monday’s work.","I missed much of the conversation because I was rehearsing another task in my head."]},"advanced-native-1824-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["One brief message does not establish that she travelled far without fully arriving; the later account describes her attention returning to the visit."],"options":["She spent the visit rehearsing work instead of listening to her friend.","One brief message does not establish that she travelled far without fully arriving; the later account describes her attention returning to the visit.","The five-minute update means she remained mentally absent for the whole afternoon."]},"advanced-native-1824-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["地理地址必定找錯，身體還未抵達。"],"options":["人已在目的地，注意力仍困在別處。","地理地址必定找錯，身體還未抵達。","需具體說心思仍在哪裏，以及漏過甚麼。"]},"advanced-native-1824-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I had travelled far without fully arriving, and I missed part of what you said; could you tell me again while I put the work plan aside?"],"options":["I thought sitting beside you meant I had taken in the whole conversation, even while thinking about Monday.","I would answer from what I expect you