('advanced-native-1825', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1825-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["網上連繫增加可接觸藝術家的機會，親訪限制仍在。"],"options":["社團以前已可聽完全相同藝術家，接觸範圍沒有變。","網上工作坊只提供場地地圖，未能聽藝術家。","社團已安排所有藝術家到訪，時間費用不再待考慮。","網上連繫增加可接觸藝術家的機會，親訪限制仍在。"]},"advanced-native-1825-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["There are more ways to learn, even though travelling to meet them still has limits.","The connection has widened our choices without settling every practical arrangement.","The world has opened up for the club through artists we can now hear online.","We can reach people whose workshops were previously beyond our access."],"options":["There are more ways to learn, even though travelling to meet them still has limits.","The connection has widened our choices without settling every practical arrangement.","The world has opened up for the club through artists we can now hear online.","We can reach people whose workshops were previously beyond our access."]},"advanced-native-1825-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The world may have opened up through the programme, but her available choices still depend on the timetable."],"options":["The world may have opened up through the programme, but her available choices still depend on the timetable.","The added programmes all share the student’s available hours, so she can choose by destination alone.","Her difficulty is choosing a preferred country rather than finding a compatible timetable."]},"advanced-native-1825-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["所有新機會都已確定可行，而且每人條件相同。"],"options":["所有新機會都已確定可行，而且每人條件相同。","仍需看誰有何種實際途徑與限制。","他們可能有更多可接觸經驗或機會。"]},"advanced-native-1825-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The world has opened up for us, but let us compare the workshop times before choosing which opportunity we can actually use."],"options":["I would choose the most distant artist first and ask about the timing after confirming our place.","The world has opened up for us, but let us compare the workshop times before choosing which opportunity we can actually use.","I assumed the new connection meant each workshop would be scheduled around our club’s usual meeting."]},"advanced-native-1825-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The world has opened up for me now that I can read your letters in their original language. Could you tell me how the ordinary morning in your story connects with the neighbourhood you grew up in?","Since I began reading your letters, the world has opened up beyond the few books I knew at home. I would love to ask why you chose the market as the place where your two characters first speak."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1826', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1826-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者的行程太滿，犧牲了自己珍惜的談話時間。"],"options":["說話者已預留整個晚上談話，活動沒有佔去那段時間。","姨母在出發前已要求取消所有探訪，所以沒有談話。","說話者的行程太滿，犧牲了自己珍惜的談話時間。","六項活動只是可選清單，說話者只選了一項。"]},"advanced-native-1826-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The schedule crowded out the conversation I valued most.","The full schedule left too little room for the conversation I had hoped to have with her.","The number of stops did not match what I actually wanted from the visit.","I had packed six activities into two days and left no time to talk properly with my aunt."],"options":["The schedule crowded out the conversation I valued most.","The full schedule left too little room for the conversation I had hoped to have with her.","The number of stops did not match what I actually wanted from the visit.","I had packed six activities into two days and left no time to talk properly with my aunt."]},"advanced-native-1826-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The list alone does not show that each person is packing six activities into two days, because participants choose only one."],"options":["The six titles establish that every participant has agreed to attend all the sessions.","Choosing one workshop means the other five have been cancelled for everyone.","The list alone does not show that each person is packing six activities into two days, because participants choose only one."]},"advanced-native-1826-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["無論活動長短和參與方式，安排一定不可行。"],"options":["可再查看交通、休息和實際想達成的目的。","很多活動被排進較短時段。","無論活動長短和參與方式，安排一定不可行。"]},"advanced-native-1826-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I packed six activities into two days, but speed was not what I wanted from the visit; could we leave some stops out and keep time to talk?"],"options":["I packed six activities into two days, but speed was not what I wanted from the visit; could we leave some stops out and keep time to talk?","I would shorten the conversation first so that the number of completed stops stays the same.","I thought reaching each stop mattered more than leaving unhurried time with my aunt, even though the conversation was what I had most wanted."]},"advanced-native-1826-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["We are packing ten activities into three days while also asking everyone to finish a piece of work. Could we agree which sessions support that goal and leave enough time for making?","Packing ten activities into three days may leave the project without the attention it needs. I would like us to choose the most relevant sessions before setting the making timetable."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1828', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1828-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者按閱讀與從容活動的需要選地方，不以距離為首要。"],"options":["說話者按閱讀與從容活動的需要選地方，不以距離為首要。","說話者認為最遠的地方才可能有圖書館。","說話者選了最密集的行程，只因它比其他地方遠。","小鎮是全班統一選擇，說話者沒有說自己的喜好。"]},"advanced-native-1828-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The choice reflected my current preferences, not a claim that it would suit everyone.","I wanted somewhere that fits me, with books and room for a slower day.","Its library and short walks matched what I wanted after term.","I was looking for time to read rather than the longest journey."],"options":["The choice reflected my current preferences, not a claim that it would suit everyone.","I wanted somewhere that fits me, with books and room for a slower day.","Its library and short walks matched what I wanted after term.","I was looking for time to read rather than the longest journey."]},"advanced-native-1828-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["We should ask whether it is somewhere that fits us both before booking a shared plan."],"options":["The different preferences show that neither friend has any interest in travelling.","We should ask whether it is somewhere that fits us both before booking a shared plan.","One friend’s enthusiasm confirms that the other person wants the same evenings."]},"advanced-native-1828-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["它已被證明是適合所有人的最佳目的地。"],"options":["地方某些特點配合我的喜好或需要。","它已被證明是適合所有人的最佳目的地。","仍可說明哪些條件配合自己，以及哪些要再查。"]},"advanced-native-1828-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I chose somewhere that fits me; the distance does not tell us whether it offers the kind of day I want."],"options":["I chose somewhere that fits me; the distance does not tell us whether it offers the kind of day I want.","I assumed a longer journey would necessarily give me more time to read once I arrived.","I would rank the places by distance first and consider the library only if the journeys were equal."]},"advanced-native-1828-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I recommended somewhere that fits me without first asking what you wanted from the evenings. Next time I will listen to your interest in live music rather than assume my quiet village is the right choice for you.","I should have helped you find somewhere that fits you, not simply repeated my own preference for quiet. Thank you for explaining the difference; I would like to ask about your plans before recommending another place."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1829', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1829-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者喜歡演出，同時已很疲累，暫不回訊息。"],"options":["說話者因討厭所有演出而決定不再參加節慶。","說話者仍很有精力，想再加入一場深夜談話。","說話者把訊息刪掉，從此不再跟朋友聯絡。","說話者喜歡演出，同時已很疲累，暫不回訊息。"]},"advanced-native-1829-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I wanted to answer after resting, rather than struggle to follow the messages that night.","Enjoying the performances had not stopped the day from being tiring.","I felt wrung out after the long festival day.","I did not have enough energy for another late conversation."],"options":["I wanted to answer after resting, rather than struggle to follow the messages that night.","Enjoying the performances had not stopped the day from being tiring.","I felt wrung out after the long festival day.","I did not have enough energy for another late conversation."]},"advanced-native-1829-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She can feel wrung out now and still want to volunteer again next month."],"options":["She can feel wrung out now and still want to volunteer again next month.","Feeling tired establishes that she no longer values the activity.","Her plan to return means she cannot be describing present exhaustion."]},"advanced-native-1829-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["當事人必定討厭剛做過的活動。"],"options":["當事人必定討厭剛做過的活動。","仍可需要休息後再決定下一步。","當事人現在非常疲累。"]},"advanced-native-1829-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I loved it, but I feel wrung out; could we talk tomorrow when I can give the conversation more attention?"],"options":["I would keep talking tonight to prove that I enjoyed the performances.","I thought wanting to rest meant there was no point asking me about the performances later.","I loved it, but I feel wrung out; could we talk tomorrow when I can give the conversation more attention?"]},"advanced-native-1829-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I care about the exhibition, but I feel wrung out after the full day on reception and cannot promise two more hours tonight. I can send you t