r than the repeated decisions.","It stopped feeling like a break and started feeling like a test because those evenings were spent fixing arrangements, not recovering from the day."]},"advanced-native-1836-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The party could stop feeling like a break and start feeling like a test if everyone has to perform for a score. Could we make the games optional and ask what kind of time together our friend actually wants?","I worry the evening will stop feeling like a break and start feeling like a test with so many compulsory turns on stage. Let us offer a quieter way to join in rather than assume everyone enjoys being judged."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
